CHANGES
Checked: 68fe3ba2..HEAD. 119/119 vitest pass (verify.cmd); tsc clean for impl files; routes/paths/x-permission/If-Match/Idempotency-Key match partners.yaml; no hex/inline style/raw table; no console logging; only owned paths (e2e/partners per 01 §3 l.179).

1. apps/web/src/features/partners/server/types.ts:31 + components/ManifestReceive.tsx:155 — `referrer.mapping_state` is invented: contracts/openapi/partners.yaml ManifestLine.referrer (l.6495-6507) has only `id`, `display_name`. Field is always undefined, so every doctor on SM-2 gets the "Not confirmed" badge, including confirmed ones (wrong information to receiving staff). Fix: delete `mapping_state?` from the ManifestLine referrer type and stop rendering the badge (show only `display_name`); writer files `.orchestra/cr/C13.T16.md` asking to add the mapping state to ManifestLine.referrer so 04-UI-UX:214 "Not confirmed warning badge if unmapped" can be built.
2. apps/web/src/features/partners/components/ManifestReceive.tsx:29,156 — clinical note is cut at 80 chars with no way to read the rest; 04-UI-UX:214 requires "full text in a row `Drawer`" (D-102). Fix: when `clinical_note.length > 80`, render a kit `Button size="sm" variant="ghost"` "Show note" that opens a kit `Drawer` titled with the line reference containing the full `clinical_note`.
3. apps/web/src/features/partners/server/actions.ts:57 — `searchDoctorsAction` caps `q` at 100, but catalog.yaml DoctorSearchRequest.q has `maxLength: 64` (l.10079); a 65-100 char query returns 400 and the map dialog shows no hits. Fix: `q(text, 64)`.

Note (not blocking): settings page (app/(staff)/partners/settings/page.tsx:12) opens on `partners.partner.read` while routes.yaml:184 says `partners.partner.manage`; API GET allows read and Save is hidden, tests require it — lead to confirm. E2E not run (env-skipped).
